					<description>Status: Operational
Operator: Tengizchevroil — Chevron 50% (operator), ExxonMobil 25%, KazMunayGas 20%, LukArco 5%
Role: Kazakhstan&apos;s largest field, onshore near the Caspian; crude blended into CPC Blend and exported via the CPC pipeline to Novorossiysk
Capacity: ~950,000 b/d following the FGP-WPMP expansion (first oil January 2025) — roughly 50% above pre-expansion output
Recent: January 2026 fires at on-site power facilities forced a near-total shutdown for most of the month; full production was targeted back by 23 February, with no further disruption reported since
