					<description>Status: Operational
Operator: Waha Oil Company — NOC 59.16%, ConocoPhillips 20.42%, TotalEnergies 20.42%
Role: Sirte Basin field producing since 1961 — linked to the Es Sider export terminal via the Gialo-Waha line
Capacity: ~130,000 b/d design (2020); ran ~245,000 b/d in 2012, likely below design now as the field matures
