Capacity: ~900,000 b/d of Arabian Heavy plus associated gas and condensate
Connectivity: Island and platform wells to onshore central processing, feeding the heavy-crude system toward the Jubail-area refineries and export terminals
Recent: Purpose-built to feed the kingdom&apos;s heavy-conversion refineries — the field and its refinery customers were designed as one system
