					<name>MiRO Karlsruhe Refinery — Mineraloelraffinerie Oberrhein</name>
					<description>Status: Operational
Owner: MiRO GmbH &amp; Co. KG — Shell 32.25%, ExxonMobil/Esso 25%, Rosneft Deutschland 24% (under German state trusteeship), Phillips 66 18.75%
Capacity: ~15 Mt/yr (~300,000 b/d) — Germany&apos;s largest refinery
Feedstock: Diverse imported crudes from Trieste via the Transalpine Pipeline (TAL); ~730,000 m³ of crude storage in 19 tanks
Main products: Gasoline, diesel, heating oil, jet components, LPG, propylene, bitumen, sulphur, petrochemical feedstocks
