Feedstock: Omani crude from the Main Oil Line
Main products: Gasoline, diesel, jet fuel, LPG, fuel oil for the capital region
Markets: Muscat and northern Oman; linked south-north with Sohar via the products pipeline
Recent: Operating as the domestic half of OQ&apos;s refining pair while Duqm takes the export role
Strategic role: The original downstream anchor — refinery, crude terminal and headquarters on one Muscat headland
Risks: Ageing units; urban encirclement; small scale against modern export refineries</description>
