Main products: Gasoline, diesel, jet, LPG, naphtha, aromatics, polymer feedstocks
Markets: Northern Oman and export via the port; products south to Muscat by pipeline
Recent: The complex sits in the port that became a 2026 workaround hub — ADNOC rerouted naphtha exports through Sohar with ship-to-ship transfers to bypass the closed strait
Strategic role: Oman&apos;s industrial-refining hub on the Gulf of Oman — inside the crisis zone&apos;s geography but outside its chokepoint
