Recent: FID Jan 2024; crude distillation ceased March 2025; conversion columns erected Feb 2025; start-up 2027; ~620,000 t CO₂/yr Scope 1+2 cut via end of crude processing and electrification
Strategic role: A live case of refinery repurposing rather than closure — and a driver of the RMR pipeline&apos;s growing importance as regional crude runs decline
