Role: Mediterranean terminus of the ~1,767 km BTC pipeline from Sangachal (Baku) — the Caspian&apos;s non-Russian export gate for Azeri Light, Shah Deniz condensate and Kazakh transshipped volumes
Capacity: &gt;1 million b/d through the pipeline
Berths / vessel size: Two berths on a ~2.5 km offshore jetty; vessels to ~300,000 dwt, two tankers simultaneously
Storage capacity: Seven floating-roof tanks of ~1 million bbl each (~7 million bbl)
Main markets: Mediterranean and NW Europe
Risks: Single-corridor dependence on the Azerbaijan–Georgia–Türkiye transit; regional geopolitics</description>
