					<description>Status: Operational
Owner/Operator: TAL Group
Role: TAL&apos;s Ingolstadt-area tank farm — the delivery end of the Alpine corridor, distributing crude to Bayernoil, Gunvor Ingolstadt and the IKL line to Czechia</description>
