				</Placemark>
				<Placemark id="02F63AE6E93FCA0C0978">
					<name>Port of Moerdijk – Industrial &amp; Logistics Zone</name>
					<description>Status: Operational
Owner/Operator: Port of Moerdijk Authority
Role: Industrial, chemical and multimodal hub between Rotterdam and Antwerp — ~2,635 hectares, 400+ companies in chemicals, energy, recycling, storage and logistics
Connectivity: Seagoing vessels, barge, rail, road and pipeline on the Rotterdam–Antwerp corridor; partly an extended gateway for Maasvlakte container terminals
Strategic role: Relieves congestion at the larger ARA ports while connecting their industrial and logistics systems
Risks: Chemical accidents and fires; pipeline disruption; Rhine–Meuse waterway constraints; permitting delays</description>
