				<Placemark>
					<name>Vlissingen–Terneuzen / North Sea Port Industrial Hub</name>
					<description>Status: Operational
Cross-border Dutch-Belgian port cluster handling chemicals, fertilizers, energy products, dry bulk and offshore logistics.</description>
