			<Placemark id="0D7B0B4A7E3F6266D6D6">
				<name>NATO pipeline</name>
				<description>Status: Operational
Route: The Central Europe Pipeline System (CEPS) — NATO&apos;s largest fuel network, linking ports, refineries, storage depots, military bases and major civil airports across France, Belgium, Luxembourg, Germany and the Netherlands
Owner/Operator: NATO (CEPS)
Handles: Refined products only — jet fuel, diesel, gasoline, naphtha; normally no crude
Strategic role: Built to secure military fuel supplies, used for civilian distribution in peacetime — a standing element of European fuel resilience and military logistics</description>
