					<name>PSO Zulfiqarabad Oil Terminal (ZOT)</name>
					<description>Status: Operational
Role: Pakistan&apos;s largest oil storage facility (~450,000 t of products) — PSO&apos;s principal coastal tank farm at Pipri, under expansion</description>
